id: STYLE-035
ilities: [modifiability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Unnecessary async function (no await inside)
category: style
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: async\s+function\s+\w+\s*\([^)]*\)\s*\{\s*return\s
    message: "async function that immediately returns — unnecessary async wrapper adds overhead"
  - regex: async\s*\([^)]*\)\s*=>\s*[^{]
    message: "async arrow function with expression body (no await) — async is unnecessary"
fix: Remove async if the function doesn't use await. Just return the value directly.
